      "paperId": "2b6c8af03713f0659f6fc2a806b58fd84f28d93f",
      "title": "COMMODITY FETISHISM AND HYDRIC IDEOLOGY: A MATERIALIST READING OF FALSE CONSCIOUSNESS IN THE ANIMATED MOVIE RANGO",
      "authors": [
